WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:38.920
Are you kidding me?! This guy Madchar
led Gottn and others aboard the Argama...

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.620
just to save his own skin?!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.540
Naturally, Gottn came
with a mobile suit,

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.750
and when Chara joined the fight,
the Argama was in danger!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.560
Please think how hard it is
for a boy who has to...

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.850
fight a mobile suit without
damaging the Argama!

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:01.020
RETRIEVE THE CORE TOP!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.250
Emary...

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.460
Didn't he just say ''Emary''?

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.380
The captain's been living the bachelor
life for a long time, after all.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.460
That's a heck of
a thing to say!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.100
C'mon, that's just
the way adults are.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.130
Ow!

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.270
Lemme see, too!

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:45.570
Me, too.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.150
Here, Captain.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:05.460
Thank you. Now, what are
you all doing here?!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.560
Report!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.000
Mr. Madchar wants you
on the mobile suit deck, sir.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.070
Did he tell you to peek
into my room, as well?!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.470
I can't! Please, get out!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.240
lt's okay.
Don't worry about it.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.240
I am worrying!

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.630
Mr. Madchar.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.130
Did you read
your orders, Captain?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:32.470
The Argama's to attack
Axis by itself? Impossible!

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:34.450
That's why we had the
La Vie en Rose refit the ship.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:38.060
Mister, don't think you're
too old to get so excited?

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:41.880
We're the ones who pilot
the mobile suits, after all.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.400
Don't lose your nerve, kid.
You've got the Mega Rider, too.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.830
Mega Rider?

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.170
Exactly. There.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.130
This?

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.540
So, what is the Mega Rider?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.050
It isn't a mobile suit, is it?
Is it a mega launcher?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.050
lt's a vehicle for mobile suits.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.050
Like the Shackles?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.150
Not even close!
Its mobility is incomparable!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:11.160
It's like a mega launcher
docked with a Shackles.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.890
You have this, your upgraded
mega particle cannon,

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:17.900
three Gundam mobile suits,
and a Newtype, to boot.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.570
Newtype?

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.170
That's right, kid!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.270
l can tell by seeing how you've fought.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:25.670
I'm getting tired
fighting these new models.

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.570
Why don't you
try it once, old man?

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.010
Oh, well maybe I will!

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.240
I can't allow that, Mr. Madchar!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.150
Why not?

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.650
I just can't!

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:37.190
Mr. Judau.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.650
Mr. Judau?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.980
l heard about your little sister!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.560
About Leina?

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.860
lt's sad. Really sad.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:52.560
If you destroy Axis,
she might get caught in that, too!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.700
Leina would be caught in it?

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.330
Leina!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.150
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.880
I'm not letting her
get caught with Axis!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.150
Calm down, Judau!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.210
There's nothing to worry about.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.860
We'll save Leina
before we destroy Axis!

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:23.210
That's right. Why else do
we have three Gundams?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.460
Yeah... You're right.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.470
Exactly!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.470
We'll rescue Leina,
as the Gundam Team!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.300
Blowing up Axis will come later!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.360
That's right, kid!
Give it a try!

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:40.550
All right! I'll do it!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.150
Hey, Newtype!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.150
You don't have to
try so hard here.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.860
No! That was magnificent!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.730
You really moved me, Mr. Judau!

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.960
Kid!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.060
Please don't point your torch
at people, Miss Milly!

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.250
Huh? Oh, no!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.920
You okay there, Judau?
We just repainted the Zeta Gundam.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.550
You're sure it's the Argama?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.050
lt's on the right course.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.450
Okay, we'll wait here as we are.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.660
Huh? As we are?

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.060
In your own
mobile suit, of course!

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.960
Please leave the Double Zeta to me.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.220
I owe that pilot some payback!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.970
Are you still going on about that?!

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:11.970
We're not here to fight
a mobile suit battle!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:15.430
We came to launch a surprise attack.
A surprise attack!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:19.380
You think Lady Haman will give us
medals if we destroy the Argama?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:22.310
You idiot!
We can't destroy it!

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:24.320
That'd kill Mistress Chara, right?!

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:30.390
Being a commander is exhausting.
It's really been getting to me, lately.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:34.840
Now you know how
Master Mashymre felt, huh?

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.030
You talk too much!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.400
Yes, sir.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.330
- You...
- Ow!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.570
What is it?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:48.170
A big piece of junk
is floating ahead.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:49.640
An abandoned colony?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:52.650
That's it. That's it, Captain.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:56.750
If we make that our target,
we can test the new cannon.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.170
Test?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.470
Understood. Let's do it.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:05.860
Excellent!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.830
We'll be conducting
a cannon test.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.360
Route half of our engines'
output to the cannon!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.200
Aye, aye!

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.170
You're supposed to put up a
sign when there's wet paint!

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:19.670
Jeez!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:24.740
What?!

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.850
You want to save
your sister, right?

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:28.450
Of course!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.660
So, help me.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.550
Huh?

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:35.650
If you take me to Axis,
I'll return your sister.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.410
Like I can trust you?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.960
I thought we once understood
each other at Moon Moon.

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.660
C'mon, trust me.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.000
C-Cut it out!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.620
You don't really owe the
Argama anything, do you?

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.870
Well, I mainly just
want to save Leina.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:58.560
You're a smart guy.
l like people like that.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:01.450
I haven't decided yet, so...

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.650
So, say it straight!

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:06.650
Yes? No? Which is it?

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.850
Judau, don't!

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:11.560
Don't listen to her!

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.810
You kids...!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.890
Don't betray us, Judau!

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:17.200
Shipboard power
is being restricted...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.860
for the cannon firing test.

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:23.270
Stop all work until the test
is concluded. That is all.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.970
I'm sick of this!
I'm going back on my own!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:28.940
Stop it!

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.840
You'll kill him!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.410
You...!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.770
Stop!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.250
Judau!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.490
Lemme go!

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:46.260
Shoulda known these people
from Axis are all jerks!

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:47.490
You won't get away!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.800
Strange.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.870
Think they spotted us?

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.870
Don't talk!
It's suffocating in here!

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:01.370
Then please, open the hatch!
It's time we got back.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.760
Good idea!
I'm practically choking!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.750
My visor!

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.000
Stop!

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.690
Elle! Chara ran away!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:25.010
This way!

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:27.270
That Boobzilla!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.870
Target object is now
within range of our cannon.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:41.550
A target that size will be
blasted to bits with one shot.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.650
Assuming our calculations are correct.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:48.220
Energy level at 60%,
60 seconds to firing!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.810
These seats are
pretty comfortable.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:55.060
Hold fire!
Chara Soon's escaped!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.960
Which is why you should
have locked her in the brig...

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.970
however short-handed we are!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:03.110
Save it! Roux, with me!

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:06.170
Hey! What about
the cannon test?!

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:07.970
That can wait!

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:13.690
Stop!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.780
Outta my way!
I'm going home!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.420
- Why, you...!
- Trying to escape?!

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:27.140
Leave the kid
out of this, Chara!

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.160
- Judau!
- Give Shinta back!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:32.400
Shut up! You stupid...!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.970
Judau!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:42.010
If I steal this piece,
the Double Zeta is finished!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:46.250
Huh?! Isn't this paint dry yet?!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.150
- What's wrong?
- Chara's escaped!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.650
And she kidnapped Shinta!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.050
Huh?!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.150
I'll see what I can
do with the Mk. II!

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:53.450
Elle.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:58.220
They're not going to open it,
so I may as well blow it!

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.780
You won't escape!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.550
No matter how much she wants
to go back, this is going too far!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.120
I'm lightweight,
so take me with you!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:40.090
Those silhouettes...
they're undocked parts of the Double Zeta!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.800
They must have spotted us!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.900
Nel, don't be hasty!

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:48.140
Dammit!
Cleyu, Eura, follow me!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.180
Keep still.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:58.050
Roger.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.840
Even asleep,
this kid still gets in my way!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:06.260
As a parting gift,
I'll smash the Argama's main gun!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.500
Dammit, Chara,
what are you up to?

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.570
Shoot it down with
our anti-air guns!

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.830
It's one of ours!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.840
It's an enemy now!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.440
Serves you right for
working me so hard!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.510
Now fall!

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:22.710
You...!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:25.910
You little...! I can't breathe!
Let me go!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.680
What are you doing
to the Argama?!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.560
Let me go!
You're in danger, too!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.760
Then go back!

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:41.230
- Screw that!
- Then I'm not letting go!

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.470
Enemy mobile suits,
off our bow!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.570
- What?!
- Four units, confirmed!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:50.470
Why now?!

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:54.740
Elle Vianno,
Gundam Mk. II, here I go!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.170
Shake a leg, Zeta Gundam!

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:04.050
I've got my own
problems to deal with!

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:07.490
Roux Louka, Zeta Gundam,
here I go!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.420
The enemies don't have
a ship with them.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.260
They just came
in mobile suits?

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:17.200
Captain, this is a good chance.
Finish them with the cannon!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.200
That won't work
against mobile suits.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.270
All hands have
manned their turrets.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.470
Right! Lay down a barrage!

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.870
Don't let those enemy
suits near us!

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:28.970
Yeah, don't let those
enemy suits near us!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.810
Here they come.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.450
Where's the Double Zeta?!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:41.120
Nel, the undocked Double Zeta
is aft of the Argama!

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.760
Destroy it, now!

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.020
Here I go!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.330
Is it attacking the Argama?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.700
What's with these guys?!
All they do is run from us!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.680
I'm going for the Argama, too!
Take care of the two suits!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:15.320
Such a waste! I could destroy the Argama
now if Mistress Chara wasn't on board.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:21.160
I did it!
My shot hit one!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.860
You're great!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.030
Aren't I? Now die!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.500
L-Lemme go!

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:30.900
Take us back!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.420
I won't! Lemme go!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.970
I'm telling you
to let me go!

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.180
Ow! You let ME go!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.550
On the count of three,
we let each other go, okay?

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.650
Like l can trust you?

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:43.850
- Then what? We keep choking each other?!
- Iino, we're gonna try a
squeeze play on the Core Top!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:44.980
- Fine!
- How?!

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.640
- One, two, three!
- We'll dock from the
front and the rear!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.390
No way! That's nuts!

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:51.000
Can you do that?!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.320
We have to!

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:55.860
Shinta's doing his best.
Now's our chance! Let's do it!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.170
They're not docking at all.

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.140
It may be a new tactic.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.300
We'll use this chance to get them!

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.830
Kinda cowardly,
don't you think?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.290
Newbies like you
don't talk to me like that!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.380
What?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.680
The enemy's here!

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:20.850
The enemy?
That means my allies!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.290
Shinta!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.190
Uh-oh!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.110
Who's come for me?
Gottn, is it you?

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.430
Die!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:39.010
Stop it! lt's me, Chara Soon!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.310
I'm in here, too!
Stop!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:46.580
Iino, I'll dock first! Cover me!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:47.410
Gotcha!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.650
Gottn, stop it! I'm on board!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.950
That won't work
as long as you're in this thing!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.040
The Core Fighter's here!

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.000
All right! It must be Judau!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.430
Iino, come on! Dock!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:07.850
On it!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.970
Don't let them! Shoot it down!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.750
Dammit! The control
system's been cut off!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.780
l told you to give up.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.780
Gottn, don't shoot!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:28.320
- Gottn won't hear you,
however much you shout!
- Iino, when I give the word,
fire missiles, then separate!

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:30.590
- It's me! Chara Soon!
- Iino, when I give the word,
fire missiles, then separate!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.220
- Gottn! Don't shoot!
- I'll handle the docking!

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:33.560
- Gottn! Don't shoot!
- Gotcha!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:34.660
Fire!

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:41.630
Separating!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.380
Go!

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.270
All right!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:57.530
They... They've docked?
One seemed to be running, though.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.120
Transforming!

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.890
D-Do we run for it,
Commander?

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.400
That's not the way to put it!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.260
We'll rendezvous with
Eura and Cleyu. Come on!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.200
Iino! Qum! You okay?

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:18.200
Yeah, we're fine.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.470
Target the Argama's engines!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.610
Huh? But if they explode,
Mistress Chara will be...!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.050
We'll be careful.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.150
We'd better not!
Go around to the side!

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:35.300
Their rear gunner is really good!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.990
Aim to the side
of the bridge!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:41.020
Why can't I hit them
like I did before?!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:44.330
Gunners, shoot down those
mobile suits aft of us!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.620
We'll make it through this, right?

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.100
- I won't know that till it's over!
- Captain!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.170
Let's go, Nel!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.040
Roger!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.910
They have more mobile suits?!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.250
Back off!
Too risky from this direction!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.390
Okay, close the hatch!
We can't let them figure it out!

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:10.390
We'll target the front!
Nel!

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:13.890
Commander!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.310
You won't escape!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:27.370
What's that? A mobile suit?

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:33.090
- What's...
- ... that?

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.480
The Qubeley?!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.080
You know that mobile suit?

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.050
That's Haman Karn's
personal machine.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.570
Wh-What?!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.990
The cannon! Shoot it
down with the cannon!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.660
Mr. Madchar, I'm in command here!
Please be quiet!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.640
What's...?

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.710
Argama, recover
the Core Fighter! Hurry!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.450
There's something over there!

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.120
Y-Yeah.

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.590
What?!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.960
Roux!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.600
Elle!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:38.040
Why, you...!

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:40.250
What is that?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:43.420
A bit attack!
The pilot's a Newtype!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.750
Haman! It's Haman!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:49.120
Prepare to fire the cannon!
Have the Gundam Team pull back!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.690
It's fast!

00:20:56.510 --> 00:21:00.310
Argama, give us some support!
This thing's tough!

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:01.930
Quit complaining!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.870
l don't have time to be flattered!

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.770
Energy at 90%!

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:06.770
Avoid it!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:08.340
Just hurry up!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:09.280
Don't get caught up!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.440
Roger!

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:21.150
Gundam Team has
cleared the firing path!

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.920
Right! Fire cannon!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:58.660
What the hell...?!
That thing's like a Colony Laser!

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:03.460
No! Leina is gonna be
caught in that!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.070
NO!!!

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.570
Judau!

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:12.370
Judau, what's wrong?!

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:14.210
I'm going to Axis!

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:18.740
I'll sneak in and rescue Leina!
Once I have, I'll come back!

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:24.720
No! Stop!
You can't do this on your own!

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:27.850
Come back! Hey! Judau!

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:31.820
Judau! Come back!
What can you do on your own?!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:49.060
I don't know anything
about Haman's Axis,

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:51.900
but forcing myself in is the
simplest way to deal with this.

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:54.460
And I successfully
sneak into Axis!

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:57.320
But, who's this weird girl?

00:23:57.320 --> 00:23:59.910
Elpeo Ple...?

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:04.510
She claims she knows about Leina,
so I have to do what she says.

00:24:04.510 --> 00:24:08.040
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Haman's Black Shadow."

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:10.880
HAMAN'S BLACK SHADOW

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:10.880
Next Time

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:10.210
Is this a meeting
of fellow Newtypes?
